                                <ul>
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i><span>Paints/Coatings: </span>0.5% – 5% depending on the desired opacity and finish</li>
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i><span>Plastics: </span>0.1% – 2% based on the resin and end-use requirement</li>
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i><span>Inks: </span>Up to 10% for concentrated color formulations</li>
